{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/50404-skype-game-seeking-players","id":50404,"title":"Skype Game Seeking Players","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-15T21:07:14-08:00","id":50404,"title":"Skype Game Seeking Players","content":"<b>EDIT: UPDATED APRIL 13!</b><br /> <br /> Sup? I'm running a Skype game on Friday mornings, from approx. 11 AM (EST) to 3 PM (also EST). So, you ask, what is the game about? Here's a blurb.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> For hundreds of years, magic has been leeching <i>out</i> of the mundane World. Every passing decade contained less wonder, less mystery and less legend. Monsters and miracles dwindled, making life safer and more stable. Times became less interesting. There were no dragons beyond the edges of the map, and no faeries lurking in the forests. Even the depths of the sea were empty of serpents. Magic was needed for a more important purpose: binding the Titans. Now they\u2019re free, their prison broken and magic is bleeding back into the world.<br /> <br /> In the Overworld, a war rages between the elemental Titans and the divine Pantheons. Ineffable forces have been leashed by both sides, setting whole realms aflame. No effort, and only minutes of time, can be spared for the mortal World. To preserve Earth and humanity against a resurgence of unfamiliar magic and the slowly reawakening minions of the Titans, the Gods have awakened the sleeping blood in a handful of Scions to be their agents on the mortal plane.<br /> <br /> So far, the touch of magic on the World is light, but things are not what they seem. That huge man with the fiery temper might just be a Giant in disguise, and maybe that \u2018mutated dog\u2019 your neighbor keeps trying to get rid of is actually a Chupacabra. The world is a strange place, and you\u2019re part of the strangeness. Less than a month ago you learned that <i>you</i> aren\u2019t what you seem. One of your parents is a God, making you a Scion. It\u2019s your job to shepherd the World into a new era. Starting with Seattle. Better hurry, because things are getting hairy fast. </div> </div> </div><br /> The setting is low-powered, and I'm running a lighter version of Scion's system. Epic Attributes are stripped down to 1 success per dot, Knacks after your first are no longer free, everything is considered Associated and some other changes. The game will be running at least up to Demigod, staying fairly low-tone and low-power. At Demigod, things will be re-evaluated and any changes made. <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_Ep3DOSZ6QZ8Js5NRSjV5hBXIkwJXJGoit46v1M-uIo/edit\" target=\"_blank\">You can view the house rules document here.</a><br /> <br /> If you're interested, reply here, IM me or hit me up on Skype (where we'll be playing via voice for sessions, text for non-session scenes). SomnorianBadgerMonster.<br /> <br /> <br /> We've played 11 sessions, but some players have had to drop out due to scheduling conflicts. Currently I have 4, but I'd like to get up to 5, maybe 6 PCs. Currently, I have...<ul><li>Teague, Scion of Bridget: A native Seattle indie musician that's demonstrated uncommon bravery, becoming the Band's reluctant leader</li> <li>Diesel, Scion of Heimdall: A brilliant biologist that wants to use science to improve humanity</li> <li>Noah, Scion of Odin: A handsome and valiant frat-boy that wants to impress his father, save the world and defend his friends</li> <li>Harry, Scion of Kalfu: A cowardly young man, terrified of his father and desperate to find a 'normal' life despite the chaos around him</li> </ul>If you want to check out their adventures so far, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/?pli=1&amp;authuser=0#folders/0B4ZdNePCDLAvN2ZyWERpelNIVDA\" target=\"_blank\"><u><b>click here</b></u></a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":235,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","user":"Telgar","date":". 04-13-2014, 01:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T21:45:20-08:00","id":50425,"title":"","content":"I endorse this recruitment message.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>former lightmaguz","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/514-auron","name":"Auron","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T23:00:06-08:00","id":50458,"title":"","content":"Gee, Telgar, that sounds like fun! I, too, endorse this advertisement! <br /> <br /> \u00b7\u00b7\u00b7Endorsement courtesy of Mike Ruiz, Scion of the great God Quetzalcoatl\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T15:55:14-08:00","id":51124,"title":"","content":"The game time has moved from Wednesday mornings to Friday mornings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T19:42:38-08:00","id":51309,"title":"","content":"I updated the game Blurb to be more descriptive, since my players told me the first one wasn't evocative enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T20:15:19-08:00","id":51325,"title":"","content":"The game setting sounds very interesting, but doesn't the lower epic scaling mean that even gods can be defeated by a couple of mortals working together? Or is that the kind of feeling you are going for in this game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1505-charles-red","name":"Charles Red","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T20:25:27-08:00","id":51337,"title":"","content":"Gods have 11-dot traits, Knacks, Boons and Ultimate-level effects. They're not in significant danger from mortals. And also since I don't plan to have this game reach God-level, I'm free to narrate the Gods instead of assigning systems to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T05:45:38-08:00","id":52314,"title":"","content":"I imagine only a few gods have 11 dot traits and ultimate level effects, but narrating the gods is probably the best way to go with a system like this. Otherwise they would have trouble with the first mortal army that looked at them funny. Hmm, do you use JSR material when it does not go against your house rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1505-charles-red","name":"Charles Red","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T08:06:34-08:00","id":52389,"title":"","content":"To some degree, yes. I generally follow them when it comes to what kind of powers a God will display, but since I'm not using Associated Powers that doesn't matter for PCs. I don't use their Fatebonds, XP rules and I have significantly different views of balanced powers than they do, so only some of their Knacks and Boons are allowed. Their site is an acceptable inspiration, but not a rules reference.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T17:08:42-08:00","id":60237,"title":"","content":"*bump*<br /> <br /> We've got 3 players now and I'd be happy with 4 if anyone else is interested. Still playing Friday mornings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T20:38:24-08:00","id":63267,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested at having a go at it if you'd have me. That is, if you don't mind me showing up at around 12pm at the earliest. I unfortunately happen to be in class from 11-11:45 a.m. but it is the last class of the day for me so anything after wouldn't pose a problem.<br /> <br /> Edit: Afterthought, what pantheons are the PCs from so far? Somewhat curious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":731,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/731-lurker","user":"Lurker","date":". 02-01-2014, 11:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/731-lurker","name":"Lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar731_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T21:38:50-08:00","id":63280,"title":"","content":"We're actually filled up now, though if anyone ends up canceling I'll post another notice.<br /> <br /> I have Irish, Loa (Umbanda), Greek (Roman), Aztec and Norse player characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T22:02:48-08:00","id":74116,"title":"","content":"We're not filled up anymore! Two players have had to withdraw from the game due to various circumstances. See the updated main post for the current state of affairs, but long story short:<br /> <br /> I'm looking for 1-2 new players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T06:34:44-08:00","id":81558,"title":"","content":"would you happen to know the gmt?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1584-oberon","name":"Oberon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T08:42:11-08:00","id":81608,"title":"","content":"16-20 GMT.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T22:23:44-07:00","id":111911,"title":"","content":"Hello! We're looking for 1, <i>maybe</i> 2, more players for this game. If you're interested, hit me up here or on Skype (SomnorianBadgerMonster). Here's a recap of the game thusfar in short-form.<br /> <br /> <b>Here Be Dragons: the Story so Far</b><br /> Things started off fairly simple: a group of mysterious \u2018bumps\u2019 in the Seattle Harbor turned out to be distressed Kappa searching for their \u2018Grandmother\u2019, a giant turtle who had brought them all the way from Japan for urgent business, only to vanish mysteriously. Attempts to track down Grandmother lead the Band to a broken spear. Consulting two mysterious, magical creatures working at the University revealed that the spear was of Fomorian origin. What might have become a deadly confrontation with the Fomorian gang in town turned out differently when one of the Scions became engaged to the Fomorian prince\u2019s sea-witch sister.<br /> <br /> Following up the disappearance of a few tourists in the Underground, the Band discovered that they had fallen victims to a colony of trolls. Easily wiping out one band, the Band dealt with the girls\u2019 remains as best as they could and returned to the surface. A few problems with the city\u2019s police force were coming to a head. New information came to light, revealing that several of the officers were thralls to a jotun named Vinnie.<br /> <br /> When the Band started tugging on Vinnie\u2019s web of servants, the jotun struck back, lashing out at their mortal connections. His thralls gathered up helpless mortals, and the Band was able to untangle them from the legal net via felonies and blood offerings. As the Scions became more enmeshed in the supernatural scene of Seattle, they uncovered the Maenads who own the Purple Pinecone Wine Bar, met an enigmatic Russian scientist of unknown intentions and learned of two other groups: the centaurs who own the Iron Horse Auto Body Shop and the \u2018cats\u2019, a band of drug-smuggling Mexican men with tattoos and a nasty reputation for violence.<br /> <br /> After a visit to three powerful sisters that represent past, present and future, the Band now knows they\u2019re in the center of magic\u2019s re-emergence into the world.. and possibly about to witness the end of everything they\u2019ve ever known. Freely giving Odin\u2019s blood to Vinnie may just have given him the key he needs to unleash an ancient force and set in motion the apocalypse.<br /> <br /> Following the advice of the sisters, the Band was able to contact the Guardians that protect the barrier between the prison of the Titans and the World. The Guardians turned out to be a tribe of Sasquatches living in the wilderness north of Seattle. The leader of the Guardian-Sasquatches told them the tale of the Titan War and the imprisonment of the elder powers, and of the danger that Vinnie presented. The Band now knows they have just over a month until Vinnie can attempt to end the World.<br /> <br /> Returning to town, the Band started gathering allies for an assault on the Cat Gang, planning to rescue Harry\u2019s grandmother and put a stop to the Cats\u2019 crimes. The Iron Horse centaur herd has agreed to fight with them, and the assault will take place on the night of the full moon: tomorrow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T00:15:51-07:00","id":119611,"title":"","content":"Not familiar with the game but I can RP really well. Still looking?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2819-thingjob","name":"thingjob","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-07T23:52:16-07:00","id":128038,"title":"","content":"i would possibly be interested message me if you are still after players","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2943-blured","name":"Blured","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T00:17:19-07:00","id":128047,"title":"","content":"At the moment, I have 5 players and I'm not currently looking for more. Still, if anyone is just <u>super-excited</u> about the game, they're welcome to contact me via Skype and discuss character ideas. I'll post another notice if I end up actively searching again in the future!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}